  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water Harvesting, Small and Medium Dams Project (WHDP) Programme Estimate</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WHDP seeks to contribute to the commercialisation of Swazi Nation Land through increased water storage and surface area under irrigation, organised producer and water user groups, business planning and marketing while promoting environmentally sound practices and infrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
